1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
[thunder rumbling]

2
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:38,000
Detective Cole: Lily, I'm not here
to scare you.

3
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:43,000
Lily: Then why did you follow me
all the way to the ranch?

4
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Detective Cole: Because the man who took
your horse is still out there.

5
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,500
Lily: <i>He said he'd bring it back.</i>

6
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Detective Cole: He lied. He sold it
in the next county for two hundred dollars.

7
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Lily: I know. I saw the money.

8
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:12,500
Detective Cole: Then tell me his name,
and I will get your horse back.

9
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Lily: His name is Abel Crane.

10
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,000
[music]